<title>UK: Credit Local ups 2003 bond to 150 mln Ecu.</title>
<headline>Credit Local ups 2003 bond to 150 mln Ecu.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 150 million Ecu from 100 million Ecu, joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg SA and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT  **150 MLN ECU   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    11.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE **101.125  PAY DATE   L11.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	**ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED 21.JAN.97 FOR 100 MLN ECU AT</p>
<p>		AN ISSUE PRICE OF 101.30</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
